      "voiceName": "SNEAKO",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thank you to the Philippines it was honor to finally return to the motherland \u2764\ufe0f\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\udded\n\nBig stream tomorrow with a Filipino legend",
